---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Trade Kit" description="Sample itineraries, pricing structure, destination overviews, partnership terms. Download the trade kit or request it by email.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-brand-800 text-white py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-white max-w-2xl">Trade Kit</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/85 max-w-3xl">Sample itineraries, pricing structure, destination overviews, partnership terms. Download the PDF or send us a brief and we will tailor it to your client.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Download + Request -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">Download</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900">The full trade kit as a PDF.</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-brand-700">A printable document with sample itineraries, pricing principles, partnership terms, and destination overviews. Yours to keep and share internally.</p>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <a href="/trade-kit.pdf" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">
              Download Trade Kit (PDF)
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:pl-12">
          <div class="p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
            <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">Or Request a Tailored Version</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">We build one around your client.</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-brand-700">Send us a brief with your client's details and we will come back with a specific proposal within 48 hours.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
              <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">
                Send a Brief
              </a>
              <a href="mailto:trade@simplyenak.com" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-brand-200 text-brand-700 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white transition-colors">
                Email trade@simplyenak.com
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Inside -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">What's Inside</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 max-w-2xl">Everything you need to sell a food programme in Malaysia.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Sample Itineraries</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">3-day Penang, 3-day KL, 5-day multi-region. Real programmes we have run, with specific stops and timings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Pricing Structure</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Net rates. Per person, per day. Nothing hidden. You add your margin.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Destination Overviews</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Where we work: KL, Penang, Melaka, Borneo. What each place is best for.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Partnership Terms</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">No exclusivity, no minimum volume, white-label available, 48-hour proposal turnaround.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Dietary Handling</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Halal, vegan, vegetarian, GF, allergies. All of them, on the same programme if needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Contact Details</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Direct email, WhatsApp. Your dedicated contact once we start working together.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>
